<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Knight Transport cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Knight Transport cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said analyst Anthony Gallo cut the rating on Knight Transportation Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3-3/4 to 22-3/4.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
</text>
